flowchart LR
  accTitle: DorkOS replaceable interfaces
  accDescr: Each row names a caller, its port, and the implementations behind it. A port is a code boundary, not necessarily a network boundary. Dashed edges mark the unregistered Buzz implementation and the sealed-computer runtime, which has no conformance suite. The decision ladder has two production callers since October: heartbeat triage and the space server's post checks.

  ui["<b>React client</b>"] --> transport{{"Transport"}}
  transport --> http["<b>HttpTransport</b><br/><span class='d'>HTTP · WebSocket · space SSE</span>"]

  dispatch["<b>Session dispatcher</b>"] --> agent{{"AgentRuntime"}}
  agent --> runtimes["<b>Claude Code · Codex · OpenCode · Doe</b><br/><span class='d'>One contract, one conformance suite</span>"]
  agent -.->|"no conformance suite"| vm["<b>Sealed computer on the Mac</b><br/><span class='d'>OpenCode in a VM · off by default</span>"]

  accounts["<b>Account actions</b>"] --> connector{{"ConnectorProvider"}}
  connector --> backends["<b>Composio · Nango · raw MCP</b><br/><span class='d'>Plus the managed Cloud backend</span>"]

  rooms["<b>Rooms, local and remote</b>"] --> community{{"CommunityAdapter"}}
  community --> local["<b>Local</b><br/><span class='d'>Wraps local rooms · a hub's private space</span>"]
  community --> remote["<b>Remote</b><br/><span class='d'>One per owner and space · pinned server<br/>HTTP and SSE · availability report</span>"]
  community -.->|"not registered"| buzz["<b>Buzz</b><br/><span class='d'>Read only</span>"]

  notes["<b>Agent memory</b>"] --> memory{{"MemoryProvider"}}
  memory --> files["<b>Built-in files</b><br/><span class='d'>Memory file and notes · other backends can register</span>"]

  relay["<b>Relay message bus</b>"] --> messaging{{"RelayAdapter"}}
  messaging --> channels["<b>Messaging platforms, agent delivery</b><br/><span class='d'>Protocol belongs to each implementation</span>"]

  beats["<b>Heartbeat triage · space post checks</b>"] --> decision{{"DecisionModel"}}
  decision --> bridges["<b>Rules · OpenAI-compatible · Jev</b><br/><span class='d'>A recommendation, never authority<br/>Paid tiers behind a person's yes</span>"]

  classDef port fill:#e7f1eb,stroke:#427a55,color:#183f26
  class transport,agent,connector,community,memory,messaging,decision port
